  "intro": "Peru is one of the most recognized surf destinations in South America, thanks to its consistent waves year-round and more […]",
  "content_html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.incatrailmachu.com/img/peru-surf-128.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.incatrailmachu.com/img/peru-surf-128.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/71ue2th-j8BL06BryZKyz9l-9X0vahAb8ooIHKV1minWtKNA_ty-GjxmlNrTGRJe__hJS_zvGPMgFbIOle1wVRNZ8Qx_kEdSW5grj6SHslI?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/i-pExJ94Q9j1czdOhhiJFNCGPj2KnP-_-1OlRYQEydzNr4-XIa9NJt83fkDx1sVWbkb6uXqgGRSLJWKGyes0hbONt1_lS-1Nw-i8lfj1c5E?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/2m_V36j_tOmNLLR-EimD6UzNk3AyRe1dAnObFeaXl14RYkqy86lLPY--rxj1CPOPNakorh5btqT8uZo6ZBXmBM5jmFerfep5465ORoFme_U?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/CkQLKs84tMbh7AfLndwDsysiM70wRVtToZUYEyTjdEE_DFFXpMNBSAiQSDuNYibdGZ1UVWUZfOTcE79jQrIuZJYOPgbZgv1QjiAyZHEcAQ0?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Peru is one of the most recognized <strong>surf destinations in South America</strong>, thanks to its consistent waves year-round and more than <strong>2,500 km of coastline along the Pacific Ocean</strong>. Both beginners and experienced surfers can find ideal beaches to practice this exciting sport.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"best-beaches-for-surfing-in-peru\">Best Beaches for Surfing in Peru</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"chicama-la-libertad\">Chicama – La Libertad</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://theindianface.com/cdn/shop/articles/1_8cd827f7-b746-447b-acdc-0e4f11878757.jpg?v=1653306984\" alt=\"https://theindianface.com/cdn/shop/articles/1_8cd827f7-b746-447b-acdc-0e4f11878757.jpg?v=1653306984\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_nbcnews-fp-1200-630%2Cf_auto%2Cq_auto%3Abest/newscms/2015_05/863281/peru_surf_chicama_2015_01_25-2.jpg\" alt=\"https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_nbcnews-fp-1200-630%2Cf_auto%2Cq_auto%3Abest/newscms/2015_05/863281/peru_surf_chicama_2015_01_25-2.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Famous for having <strong>the longest left-hand wave in the world</strong>, where surfers can ride a single wave for an incredible distance.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Level:</strong> Intermediate to advanced<br><strong>Season:</strong> March to November</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"m-ancora-piura\">Máncora – Piura</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66b39db65f4b0e74be46aaca/a56f2e13-e96b-46d7-87f7-76dd28be9c59/surf%2Bmancora%2Bperu.jpg\" alt=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66b39db65f4b0e74be46aaca/a56f2e13-e96b-46d7-87f7-76dd28be9c59/surf%2Bmancora%2Bperu.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/7tfhIeuwbRy7DuonvvLPYQeZm8t7Nk0CdPcslM3uXILvLf4WU1E4Jd628GISnNxLs5vsnP7Goy23XstB0pizxQS4ZOylCTDIR_PhIaY0Dl0?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/7A2HLuxhcCisAagCpxo_w8fODiI-a0-uztVFOTmi_nF-DxpmvBHQPX_O9m-dljHSo0hl8Op9hq8O9hVp3TEP2BuSIxAl8dAzcbtafjeF5dM?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the most popular destinations in northern Peru, perfect for those who want to <strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">learn surfing</a> or enjoy friendly waves</strong> in a warm, tropical environment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Level:</strong> Beginner to intermediate<br><strong>Season:</strong> October to March</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"punta-rocas-lima\">Punta Rocas – Lima</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/6BRT_gpYwNn-3vfq2ycga9veNEsxFJxAKckRAaB5E2s7atW91tVaE26HToXbP5GbhrVX7ZUwhF_16Dm34SQP91p2hQr28hY7p4H3WbTUhQI?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/qujwhQfpK0z5IBblnwHQjJ_gO6t3FjFVODI4RwKzuEILdElyzOuL--G6M3Ais5dEZQA3G7gwalNIiyDV_UilHoKo643U1VWwCrjUW4mwRLs?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.surf-forecast.com/system/images/31320/large/Punta-Rocas.jpg?1766441667=\" alt=\"https://www.surf-forecast.com/system/images/31320/large/Punta-Rocas.jpg?1766441667=\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.eurosurfing.org/images/2025/WSG_Junior_Peru25/ESP_ath_Oinatz_Ortega_ath_ph_Sean_Evans_ph.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.eurosurfing.org/images/2025/WSG_Junior_Peru25/ESP_ath_Oinatz_Ortega_ath_ph_Sean_Evans_ph.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the most well-known surf spots near Lima, featuring <strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">powerful </a>waves that attract international surf competitions</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Level:</strong> Intermediate to advanced<br><strong>Season:</strong> April to October</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"best-season-for-surfing-in-peru\">Best Season for Surfing in Peru</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Northern Peru (<a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Máncora, Lobitos</a>):</strong> October – March</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Central coast (<a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Lima</a>):</strong> April – October</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>North-central coast (<a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Chicama</a>):</strong> March – November</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In general, <strong>Peru offers great surfing conditions throughout the year</strong>, depending on the region.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"plan-your-surf-experience-in-peru\">Plan Your Surf Experience in Peru</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are looking to enjoy a unique surfing adventure on Peru’s best beaches, <strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">GT Peru Travel</a></strong> can help you organize your trip with accommodation, transportation, and tours tailored to your surfing level.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Contact <a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">GT Peru Travel</a> and discover the best waves in Peru with a safe and personalized travel experience.</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
